    {
      "id": "WoHJil4RQH-gtDMgqEsLw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2911.1843092233767,
      "y": -2061.979875546398,
      "width": 759.3200073242188,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1476475320,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1985746360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308121,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When speaking with executives at **Marea**, **Íslenska Kalkþörungafélagið**,\n**Eylíf**, **Taramar**, or salmon farmers in the Icelandic fjords (such as\n**Kaldvík**, **Arnarlax**, or **Arctic Fish**), mixing up **microalgae** (which\ncause ocean \"algal blooms\") and **macroalgae** (seaweed/kelp) is the single\nfastest way to lose technical credibility.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When speaking with executives at **Marea**, **Íslenska Kalkþörungafélagið**, **Eylíf**, **Taramar**, or salmon farmers in the Icelandic fjords (such as **Kaldvík**, **Arnarlax**, or **Arctic Fish**), mixing up **microalgae** (which cause ocean \"algal blooms\") and **macroalgae** (seaweed/kelp) is the single fastest way to lose technical credibility.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cPQW5CPg8H2evadwc8lIy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273.872487759211,
      "y": 78.33468159627074,
      "width": 11.199996948242188,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4AV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 239504560,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 1553103949,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248526249,
      "created": 1792246569750,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2aaRuzPPyCEgtsG0-nQx1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2920.2542860300173,
      "y": -1879.479875546398,
      "width": 777.4599609375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 252861896,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1029915080,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308122,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "While satellite sensors from the **Copernicus Marine Service (CMEMS)** track\nboth—primarily through Chlorophyll-a, Suspended Particulate Matter (turbidity),\nSea Surface Temperature (SST), and nutrient plume hydrodynamics—industry\nplayers treat them as **two completely different supply chains**.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "While satellite sensors from the **Copernicus Marine Service (CMEMS)** track both—primarily through Chlorophyll-a, Suspended Particulate Matter (turbidity), Sea Surface Temperature (SST), and nutrient plume hydrodynamics—industry players treat them as **two completely different supply chains**.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_cghbztmWMe33Thg3CALe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2543.8543054849733,
      "y": -1696.979875546398,
      "width": 24.65999984741211,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1747010232,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 784375480,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308122,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "---",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "---",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RGViUCo1IzuW6e-LzNo-h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2795.834272602283,
      "y": -1626.979875546398,
      "width": 528.6199340820312,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 395535560,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 304597192,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308122,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## 1. The Core Distinction: Microalgae vs. Macroalgae",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## 1. The Core Distinction: Microalgae vs. Macroalgae",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VruNe0t826wBYQD0Vmoj9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2926.9943067819704,
      "y": -1619.479875546398,
      "width": 790.9400024414062,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1767386040,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1538000824,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308123,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In a business conversation, never suggest \"harvesting wild algal blooms from the\nocean\" to a seaweed company. Wild microalgae blooms in the ocean are\nmicroscopic, dispersed in trillions of liters of seawater, and often toxic. Instead,\nframe your Copernicus data around **Early Warning for Aquaculture\n(Microalgae/HABs)** and **Site Selection / Biomass Yield Optimization\n(Macroalgae)**.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In a business conversation, never suggest \"harvesting wild algal blooms from the ocean\" to a seaweed company. Wild microalgae blooms in the ocean are microscopic, dispersed in trillions of liters of seawater, and often toxic. Instead, frame your Copernicus data around **Early Warning for Aquaculture (Microalgae/HABs)** and **Site Selection / Biomass Yield Optimization (Macroalgae)**.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "w8Z_1oCHqMhIiAjbadttS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2876.8442213327517,
      "y": -1361.979875546398,
      "width": 690.6398315429688,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408652744,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 180580296,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308123,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature | Microalgae (Phytoplankton) | Macroalgae (Seaweed / Kelp) |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature | Microalgae (Phytoplankton) | Macroalgae (Seaweed / Kelp) |",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QkXLE52w_oSwSnqbBundA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2604.474310138904,
      "y": -1326.979875546398,
      "width": 145.90000915527344,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
