    {
      "id": "fRRizhs2T36vph1tYhPZA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2931.074262836658,
      "y": -1329.479875546398,
      "width": 799.0999145507812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 998691528,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1599223496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308124,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Biology & Scale** | Microscopic, single-celled organisms suspended in the water\ncolumn (e.g., *Haematococcus pluvialis*, *Spirulina*, diatoms, dinoflagellates). |\nMacroscopic, multicellular marine plants anchored to the seabed or ropes (Brown\nkelp like *Saccharina latissima*, Red algae like *Lithothamnion*, Green *Ulva*). |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Biology & Scale** | Microscopic, single-celled organisms suspended in the water column (e.g., *Haematococcus pluvialis*, *Spirulina*, diatoms, dinoflagellates). | Macroscopic, multicellular marine plants anchored to the seabed or ropes (Brown kelp like *Saccharina latissima*, Red algae like *Lithothamnion*, Green *Ulva*). |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Ne9aotsCXZ51kEJ5iXsn1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2931.3842603952517,
      "y": -1231.979875546398,
      "width": 799.7199096679688,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1125817784,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 522680760,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308126,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Relation to \"Algal Blooms\"** | **Direct:** Rapid population explosions create\nvisible **Algal Blooms** and **Harmful Algal Blooms (HABs)** tracked via satellite\nChlorophyll-a optical bands. | **Indirect:** They do not form pelagic \"blooms\"\n(except floating *Sargassum* in the tropics). However, they thrive in the exact\nsame **nutrient-rich plumes** that trigger microalgae blooms. |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Relation to \"Algal Blooms\"** | **Direct:** Rapid population explosions create visible **Algal Blooms** and **Harmful Algal Blooms (HABs)** tracked via satellite Chlorophyll-a optical bands. | **Indirect:** They do not form pelagic \"blooms\" (except floating *Sargassum* in the tropics). However, they thrive in the exact same **nutrient-rich plumes** that trigger microalgae blooms. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6h-Q6QLbuk3np1PBdI3o6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2914.854292133533,
      "y": -1096.979875546398,
      "width": 766.6599731445312,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 129055176,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1685069256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308127,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **How It Is Sourced in Iceland** | **Never harvested from the wild ocean.**\nCultivated strictly on land in sterile, closed photobioreactors using geothermal\npower and pure water. | **Wild-harvested** (by cutting coastal kelp beds or\ndredging calcified seabed deposits) or **ocean-farmed** on seeded longlines in\nfjords. |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **How It Is Sourced in Iceland** | **Never harvested from the wild ocean.** Cultivated strictly on land in sterile, closed photobioreactors using geothermal power and pure water. | **Wild-harvested** (by cutting coastal kelp beds or dredging calcified seabed deposits) or **ocean-farmed** on seeded longlines in fjords. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PU6OFlcIz_cDpnH1GRQ67",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2925.7943861276735,
      "y": -949.479875546398,
      "width": 788.5401611328125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
