      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308127,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Target Compounds** | High-value pigments (**Astaxanthin**), Omega-3\n(EPA/DHA), proteins, and cellular bioactives. | **Alginates, carrageenan, agar**\n(for Marea's bioplastics), **calcium/magnesium** (*Lithothamnion*), fucoidan, and\npolyphenols (for Taramar's skincare). |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Target Compounds** | High-value pigments (**Astaxanthin**), Omega-3 (EPA/DHA), proteins, and cellular bioactives. | **Alginates, carrageenan, agar** (for Marea's bioplastics), **calcium/magnesium** (*Lithothamnion*), fucoidan, and polyphenols (for Taramar's skincare). |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
