      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308129,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### A. Microalgae Cultivation (Land-Based Industrial Biotech)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### A. Microalgae Cultivation (Land-Based Industrial Biotech)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "L2jYRWgeZ57jpeyc0kwyY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2920.2743055612673,
      "y": -389.47987554639803,
      "width": 777.5,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1952580024,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 622910904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308130,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **The Process:** Because wild ocean phytoplankton is mixed with bacteria,\nheavy metals, and toxic species, companies in Iceland (like Algalif or Vaxa, which\nsupply brands like **Eylíf**) grow monocultures indoors inside sealed glass or\nacrylic tubes called **Photobioreactors (PBRs)**. They pump in $CO_2$ from\ngeothermal plants, pristine filtered lava-water, and use high-intensity LEDs\npowered by green hydro/geothermal electricity.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **The Process:** Because wild ocean phytoplankton is mixed with bacteria, heavy metals, and toxic species, companies in Iceland (like Algalif or Vaxa, which supply brands like **Eylíf**) grow monocultures indoors inside sealed glass or acrylic tubes called **Photobioreactors (PBRs)**. They pump in $CO_2$ from geothermal plants, pristine filtered lava-water, and use high-intensity LEDs powered by green hydro/geothermal electricity.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gvenRr3kZHhZaT1edqfrt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2925.614362934314,
      "y": -191.97987554639803,
      "width": 788.1801147460938,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2080511432,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1613691336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **The Supply Chain Gap:** They do **not** need satellite data to find algae\nin the sea, because their production is 100% indoor. They only care about ocean\ndata if they are sourcing novel wild extremophile strains for R&D.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **The Supply Chain Gap:** They do **not** need satellite data to find algae in the sea, because their production is 100% indoor. They only care about ocean data if they are sourcing novel wild extremophile strains for R&D.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a5QoMf74HkPOWQbd1aucU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2877.9743482858767,
      "y": -46.979875546398034,
      "width": 692.9000854492188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1294535352,
