      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### B. Macroalgae Sourcing (Wild Harvesting vs. Offshore Mariculture)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### B. Macroalgae Sourcing (Wild Harvesting vs. Offshore Mariculture)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eaCGc-Z0Q6T4iII2tHcmn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2911.634321430408,
      "y": 10.520124453601966,
      "width": 760.2200317382812,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1036786888,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1388085448,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308131,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is where your **Copernicus Marine Service** data has massive commercial\nvalue:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is where your **Copernicus Marine Service** data has massive commercial value:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5ef0lkfa5loHjniReKMyr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2924.824323871814,
      "y": 93.02012445360197,
      "width": 786.6000366210938,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1780937656,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 635359160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. **Wild Kelp Harvesting (Intertidal & Subtidal):** Harvesters cut wild brown\nalgae (*Laminaria hyperborea* or *Ascophyllum nodosum*) in shallow coastal bays\nusing specialized boats, rotating plots every 4 to 5 years to allow regeneration.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. **Wild Kelp Harvesting (Intertidal & Subtidal):** Harvesters cut wild brown algae (*Laminaria hyperborea* or *Ascophyllum nodosum*) in shallow coastal bays using specialized boats, rotating plots every 4 to 5 years to allow regeneration.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ENYpqTuSv1Br16YQgdFbV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2917.644331196033,
      "y": 178.02012445360197,
      "width": 772.2400512695312,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1723679688,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1208035272,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. **Calcified Seaweed Dredging (*Maerl*):** **Íslenska Kalkþörungafélagið** in\nArnarfjörður pumps dead, calcified skeletons of red coralline algae\n(*Lithothamnion*) from the seabed floor at depths of **10 to 30 meters**.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. **Calcified Seaweed Dredging (*Maerl*):** **Íslenska Kalkþörungafélagið** in Arnarfjörður pumps dead, calcified skeletons of red coralline algae (*Lithothamnion*) from the seabed floor at depths of **10 to 30 meters**.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-LvKg8_jXeSKF6DRT6zqP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2928.8242018015017,
      "y": 250.52012445360197,
      "width": 794.5997924804688,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1635761336,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 299636920,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308133,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. **Offshore Longline Cultivation (Seaweed Farming):** Spores are seeded onto\ntwine in a land hatchery, wrapped around thick carrier ropes, and deployed at sea\non floating frames (often **1 to 5 meters** below the surface) from autumn to\nlate spring.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. **Offshore Longline Cultivation (Seaweed Farming):** Spores are seeded onto twine in a land hatchery, wrapped around thick carrier ropes, and deployed at sea on floating frames (often **1 to 5 meters** below the surface) from autumn to late spring.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gGPejX4CmdnQrHCw4EGHX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2930.9142591745485,
      "y": 345.52012445360197,
      "width": 798.7799072265625,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1156680392,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 471396040,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **The Supply Chain Gap (Where You Pitch):** Currently, Icelandic startups like\n**Marea** rely on wild-harvested seaweed, which fluctuates in seasonal chemical\ncomposition and faces strict environmental harvesting quotas. To scale globally,\nthe industry must transition to **cultivated offshore seaweed farming**.\nHowever, operators lack high-resolution spatial models to know *which exact fjord\ninlets* offer the best balance of dissolved nitrogen/phosphorus, optimal\nPhotosynthetically Active Radiation (PAR), and low wave energy (to prevent\nwinter storms from ripping the lines).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **The Supply Chain Gap (Where You Pitch):** Currently, Icelandic startups like **Marea** rely on wild-harvested seaweed, which fluctuates in seasonal chemical composition and faces strict environmental harvesting quotas. To scale globally, the industry must transition to **cultivated offshore seaweed farming**. However, operators lack high-resolution spatial models to know *which exact fjord inlets* offer the best balance of dissolved nitrogen/phosphorus, optimal Photosynthetically Active Radiation (PAR), and low wave energy (to prevent winter storms from ripping the lines).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
