      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## 3. Downstream Processing (From Wet Biomass to ROI)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## 3. Downstream Processing (From Wet Biomass to ROI)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5d1R5UTRlseZEgHTlqz1r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2931.4242994577517,
      "y": 793.020124453602,
      "width": 799.7999877929688,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1364324024,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1665616568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Once macroalgae are pulled from the ocean, the clock starts ticking. Fresh\nseaweed is **80% to 90% water** and begins to ferment and rot within **24 to\n48 hours**.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Once macroalgae are pulled from the ocean, the clock starts ticking. Fresh seaweed is **80% to 90% water** and begins to ferment and rot within **24 to 48 hours**.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qdbSNwJBGF3OUOm8lcN9o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2921.7943250925173,
      "y": 913.020124453602,
      "width": 780.5400390625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 403929288,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1337056456,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. **Washing & Dewatering:** Removing epiphytes (small crustaceans, bryozoans,\nand sand—a major issue if harvested too late in the summer when water warms\nup).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. **Washing & Dewatering:** Removing epiphytes (small crustaceans, bryozoans, and sand—a major issue if harvested too late in the summer when water warms up).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QoPL0-dCyLxZnyUKxaQnC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2921.934339740955,
      "y": 998.020124453602,
      "width": 780.820068359375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1066620856,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 578630584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. **Stabilization (The Bottleneck):** Thermal drying (using Iceland's abundant\ngeothermal steam), freeze-drying (used by **Responsible Foods** for high-value\nfoods), or wet acid/ensilage preservation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. **Stabilization (The Bottleneck):** Thermal drying (using Iceland's abundant geothermal steam), freeze-drying (used by **Responsible Foods** for high-value foods), or wet acid/ensilage preservation.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
