      "created": 1792248308137,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## 4. Effects on Aquaculture: The \"Villain\" vs. The \"Hero\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## 4. Effects on Aquaculture: The \"Villain\" vs. The \"Hero\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LV16TQk-MVaz82ADIlRqG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2912.0742018015017,
      "y": 1498.020124453602,
      "width": 761.0997924804688,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 365745352,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 689518792,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When you speak to salmon farms, environmental SaaS providers (**Stika**), or\nERP providers (**Maritech**), frame the relationship between algae and fish\nfarms through these two dynamics:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When you speak to salmon farms, environmental SaaS providers (**Stika**), or ERP providers (**Maritech**), frame the relationship between algae and fish farms through these two dynamics:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cZQfnqJellnrpgBupkJON",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2826.4942762643923,
      "y": 1643.020124453602,
      "width": 589.93994140625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 430816184,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 2060031928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### Microalgae as the \"Villain\": Harmful Algal Blooms (HABs)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### Microalgae as the \"Villain\": Harmful Algal Blooms (HABs)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lbaWa9wa7VwPSBY5Bp6z7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2924.5443250925173,
      "y": 1663.020124453602,
      "width": 786.0400390625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1843854280,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 570875848,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308139,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Open-net salmon pens in the Westfjords and Eastfjords are stationary—fish\ncannot swim away when a bloom drifts into the fjord. In late 2025, major\nIcelandic salmon producer **Kaldvík** suffered severe revenue and mortality hits\nin Q3 specifically due to an algal bloom event. Microalgae blooms kill farmed fish\nthrough three mechanisms:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Open-net salmon pens in the Westfjords and Eastfjords are stationary—fish cannot swim away when a bloom drifts into the fjord. In late 2025, major Icelandic salmon producer **Kaldvík** suffered severe revenue and mortality hits in Q3 specifically due to an algal bloom event. Microalgae blooms kill farmed fish through three mechanisms:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pw7y2WBJJLxVULca1HInR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2884.134321430408,
      "y": 1858.020124453602,
      "width": 705.2200317382812,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4m",
