      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **Mechanical Gill Damage:** Certain diatoms (like *Chaetoceros*) have\nmicroscopic silica spines that lodge in the salmon's gills, causing mucus\noverproduction and suffocation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **Mechanical Gill Damage:** Certain diatoms (like *Chaetoceros*) have microscopic silica spines that lodge in the salmon's gills, causing mucus overproduction and suffocation.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lIb68Vdxl-hsQ48Vstl7c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2908.1842787057985,
      "y": 1943.020124453602,
      "width": 753.3199462890625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 774128328,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 480749256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **Ichthyotoxins & Shellfish Toxins:** Flagellates (like *Chrysochromulina*,\n*Prymnesium*, or *Alexandrium*) release neurotoxins or hemolytic toxins that\nrupture gill cells or contaminate mussel farms.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **Ichthyotoxins & Shellfish Toxins:** Flagellates (like *Chrysochromulina*, *Prymnesium*, or *Alexandrium*) release neurotoxins or hemolytic toxins that rupture gill cells or contaminate mussel farms.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "6IkDwAAfePlqIFQilmDFs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2900.6742689401735,
      "y": 2028.020124453602,
      "width": 738.2999267578125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1733045688,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 539036088,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **Nighttime Hypoxia (Oxygen Depletion):** Dense blooms consume massive\namounts of dissolved oxygen at night (or when the bloom dies and bacteria\ndecompose it), suffocating thousands of tons of fish in hours.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **Nighttime Hypoxia (Oxygen Depletion):** Dense blooms consume massive amounts of dissolved oxygen at night (or when the bloom dies and bacteria decompose it), suffocating thousands of tons of fish in hours.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lzvZJrka5-i8LqLs33aDu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2927.9242384225954,
      "y": 2075.520124453602,
      "width": 792.7998657226562,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 622897608,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 899124680,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308142,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **How Farm Operators React to Your Early Warning:** If your Copernicus +\nhydrodynamic model gives a **3-to-7-day warning** of an incoming Chlorophyll-a\nanomaly, the farm immediately **stops feeding the fish** (digestion requires up\nto 30% more oxygen and brings fish to the surface where the bloom is densest),\ndeploys **submerged aeration/upwelling tarps**, or triggers **early harvesting**\nvia **Maritech**.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **How Farm Operators React to Your Early Warning:** If your Copernicus + hydrodynamic model gives a **3-to-7-day warning** of an incoming Chlorophyll-a anomaly, the farm immediately **stops feeding the fish** (digestion requires up to 30% more oxygen and brings fish to the surface where the bloom is densest), deploys **submerged aeration/upwelling tarps**, or triggers **early harvesting** via **Maritech**.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Rl-i4ScKF7paGdyH3fOOZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2891.3143751413454,
      "y": 2333.020124453602,
      "width": 719.5801391601562,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
