      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308142,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### Macroalgae as the \"Hero\": Bioremediation & IMTA (Your Core Pitch!)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### Macroalgae as the \"Hero\": Bioremediation & IMTA (Your Core Pitch!)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "97xzSLz8RDwewOV6Actdc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2902.2142469675173,
      "y": 2378.020124453602,
      "width": 741.3798828125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1844981960,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 368219336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308143,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Intensive salmon farming releases massive amounts of **Dissolved Inorganic\nNitrogen (DIN — ammonia/nitrate)** and **Dissolved Inorganic Phosphorus\n(DIP)** from fish excretion and uneaten feed.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Intensive salmon farming releases massive amounts of **Dissolved Inorganic Nitrogen (DIN — ammonia/nitrate)** and **Dissolved Inorganic Phosphorus (DIP)** from fish excretion and uneaten feed.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qvdMA01Ib36unsqdGhInY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2923.2242567331423,
      "y": 2510.520124453602,
      "width": 783.39990234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 829824952,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1740897208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308143,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* In stagnant fjords, this nutrient plume acts as fertilizer that **triggers local\nHarmful Algal Blooms** and creates compliance problems for the farm.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* In stagnant fjords, this nutrient plume acts as fertilizer that **triggers local Harmful Algal Blooms** and creates compliance problems for the farm.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DCji254YquBt2qmmO1uJc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2924.784254291736,
      "y": 2520.520124453602,
      "width": 786.5198974609375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1615255496,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1666497480,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308144,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **The Solution — Integrated Multi-Trophic Aquaculture (IMTA):** By placing\nmacroalgae (kelp/seaweed) farms directly downstream in the nutrient plume of a\nsalmon farm, the macroalgae act as a biological sponge. Studies show macroalgae\nin IMTA setups can remove **over 80% to 100% of total ammonia nitrogen\n(TAN)** while experiencing explosive biomass growth—up to **30% to 60%\nfaster growth** than kelp grown far from fish farms.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **The Solution — Integrated Multi-Trophic Aquaculture (IMTA):** By placing macroalgae (kelp/seaweed) farms directly downstream in the nutrient plume of a salmon farm, the macroalgae act as a biological sponge. Studies show macroalgae in IMTA setups can remove **over 80% to 100% of total ammonia nitrogen (TAN)** while experiencing explosive biomass growth—up to **30% to 60% faster growth** than kelp grown far from fish farms.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0CTmVRSGohiDtQGiB9if0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2929.3642408640017,
      "y": 2693.020124453602,
      "width": 795.6798706054688,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1309239480,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 909886648,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792248308151,
      "created": 1792248308146,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* **The Biofouling Catch (Crucial Nuance):** If a harmful microalgae bloom hits a\nseaweed farm, or if water temperatures rise too high in late spring, the kelp\nblades get coated in epiphytes and slime (biofouling), ruining the batch for\nbioplastics or cosmetics. **Your satellite data tells the seaweed farmer *when to\nharvest early* before biofouling ruins the crop.**",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* **The Biofouling Catch (Crucial Nuance):** If a harmful microalgae bloom hits a seaweed farm, or if water temperatures rise too high in late spring, the kelp blades get coated in epiphytes and slime (biofouling), ruining the batch for bioplastics or cosmetics. **Your satellite data tells the seaweed farmer *when to harvest early* before biofouling ruins the crop.**",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
