      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pitch Training (3 Minutes):\n- Inspire\n- Show advantages\n- Details, Emotion, Feelings, Senses\n- V - Vision\n- A - Auditorial\n- K - Kinetics (Touch,Feel)\n- S - Smell\n- Voice \n    - Pitch, Pace, Power, Pause\n- Clarity\n- Body Language: Open vs Closed\n    - Power Pose\n- Theme Hook, Stand out\n- Yes, and...\n- Slides\n    - Good Pictures\n- Goal\n- Structure:\n    - Hook\n    - Struggle/Problem Statement\n    - Breakthrough/ Idea\n    - For whom?\n    - Who are we?\n        - Roles\n    - What do we want\n\nBala Kamallakharan CEO - Blue Nova Ventures / Startup\nIceland\nAlexandra Leeper CEO - Ocean Cluster\nAngel Luis Oceanographer -HI",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
